{"book":"mathematics-for-cs","chapter":"ch09-number-theory","chapterTitle":"نظرية الأعداد","slug":"sec-remainder-arithmetic","title":"حساب البواقي","headings":[],"html":"<h1>حساب البواقي</h1>\n<p>تقول لمّة التطابق ٩.٦.١ إن عددين متطابقان إذا وفقط إذا تساوى باقياهما، فيمكننا أن نفهم التطابقات بأن نُجري الحساب بالبواقي. وإذا لم نرد إلا باقي القسمة على <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> لسلسلة من عمليات الجمع والضرب والطرح مطبَّقة على أعداد ما، فيمكننا أن نأخذ البواقي في كل خطوة، بحيث لا يتضمّن الحساب كله إلا أعدادًا في المدى <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0..</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0..n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>.</p>\n<p><strong>المبدأ العام لحساب البواقي.</strong> لإيجاد باقي القسمة على <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> لنتيجة سلسلة من عمليات الجمع والضرب مطبَّقة على أعداد صحيحة ما:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>استبدل كل معامل صحيح ببقية قسمته على <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>،</li>\n<li>وأبقِ كل نتيجة جمع أو ضرب في المدى <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0..</mn><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0..n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> بأن تستبدل فورًا أي نتيجة تقع خارج ذلك المدى ببقية قسمتها على <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>فمثلًا، لنفترض أننا نريد إيجاد</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable width=\"100%\"><mtr><mtd width=\"50%\"></mtd><mtd><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>44427</mn><mn>3456789</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15555858</mn><mn>5555</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>403</mn><mn>6666666</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>36</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd width=\"50%\"></mtd><mtd><mtext>(9.9)</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\operatorname{rem}\\left( \\left(44427^{3456789} + 15555858^{5555}\\right) \\cdot 403^{6666666},\\ 36 \\right). \\tag{9.9}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4442</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3456789</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1555585</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5555</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6666666</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span><span class=\"katex-tag\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9.9</span></span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>يبدو هذا مخيفًا حقًّا إذا فكّرت في حساب هذه القوى الكبيرة ثم أخذ البواقي. فمثلًا يبلغ طول التمثيل العشري للعدد <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>44427</mn><mn>3456789</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">44427^{3456789}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4442</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3456789</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> نحو عشرين مليون رقم، فلا نريد بالتأكيد أن نسلك ذلك الطريق. لكن إذا تذكّرنا أن الأُسّ الصحيح إنما يحدّد سلسلة من عمليات الضرب، اتبعنا المبدأ العام واستبدلنا الأعداد المضروبة ببواقيها.</p>\n<p>وبما أن <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>44427</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rem}(44427, 36) = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">44427</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span>، و<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>15555858</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rem}(15555858, 36) = 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">15555858</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span>، و<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>403</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rem}(403, 36) = 7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">403</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span>، نجد أن (9.9) تساوي باقي القسمة على ٣٦ للعدد</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable width=\"100%\"><mtr><mtd width=\"50%\"></mtd><mtd><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3456789</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>5555</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>6666666</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mtd><mtd width=\"50%\"></mtd><mtd><mtext>(9.10)</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\left(3^{3456789} + 6^{5555}\\right) \\cdot 7^{6666666}. \\tag{9.10}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3456789</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5555</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6666666</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span><span class=\"katex-tag\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">9.10</span></span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>وهذا أفضل قليلًا، لكن طول التمثيل العشري للعدد <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3456789</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^{3456789}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3456789</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> نحو مليون رقم، فلا نزال لا نريد حسابه. لكن لننظر في بواقي القوى الأولى للعدد ٣:</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\operatorname{rem}(3, 36) = 3, \\qquad \\operatorname{rem}(3^2, 36) = 9, \\qquad \\operatorname{rem}(3^3, 36) = 27, \\qquad \\operatorname{rem}(3^4, 36) = 9 .\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>لقد حصلنا على تكرار للخطوة الثانية، <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rem}(3^2, 36)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>، بعد خطوتين إضافيتين فقط. وهذا يعني أنه انطلاقًا من <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>، ستظلّ متتالية بواقي القوى المتتالية للعدد ٣ تتكرّر كل خطوتين. إذن حاصل ضرب عدد فردي من الثلاثات، لا يقلّ عن ثلاث، سيكون له الباقي نفسه عند القسمة على ٣٦ الذي لحاصل ضرب ثلاث ثلاثات فقط. ولذلك</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3456789</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>27.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\operatorname{rem}(3^{3456789}, 36) = \\operatorname{rem}(3^3, 36) = 27 .\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3456789</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.1141em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27.</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>يا له من مكسب!</p>\n<p>وقوى العدد ٦ أسهل، لأن <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rem}(6^2, 36) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>، فتتكرّر الأصفار بعد الخطوة الثانية. أمّا قوى العدد ٧ فتتكرّر بعد ستّ خطوات، وفي الخطوة السادسة تحصل على ١، أي <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">rem</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{rem}(7^6, 36) = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">rem</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>. إذن تتبسّط (9.10) تبسّطًا متتاليًا لتصير باقي القسمة على ٣٦ للتعبير التالي:</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3456789</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>5555</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>6666666</mn></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mo>≡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>5553</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mn>6</mn></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>1111111</mn></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mo>≡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>1111111</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mspace></mspace><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mspace width=\"0.3333em\"/><mn>36</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\left(3^{3456789} + 6^{5555}\\right) \\cdot 7^{6666666}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\equiv \\left(3^3 + 6^2 \\cdot 6^{5553}\\right) \\cdot \\left(7^6\\right)^{1111111}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad \\equiv (27 + 0) \\cdot 1^{1111111} = 27 \\pmod{36} .\n\\end{aligned}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:4.4763em;vertical-align:-1.9882em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.4882em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.6922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0681em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9641em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0681em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.4399em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0681em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.9882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.4882em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.6922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0681em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mor